### =====================================================================
### RECOMPENSAS — GET/POST /recompensas, GET/PUT/:id, PATCH /:id/status
### Criação, edição e status exigem papel "gestor".
### A recompensa criada aqui é reutilizada em 08-resgates.http.
### =====================================================================

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cnpj": "{{cnpj}}",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "senha": "{{senha}}"
}
###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Listar recompensas (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recompensas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar recompensa (201)
# @name criarRecompensa
POST {{baseUrl}}/recompensas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Café grátis",
  "descricao": "Um café expresso cortesia",
  "custoPontos": 50
}

@recompensaId = {{criarRecompensa.response.body.$.id}}

### Criar recompensa — payload inválido (422, custoPontos precisa ser positivo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recompensas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "X",
  "custoPontos": -10
}

### Buscar recompensa por id (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recompensas/{{recompensaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar recompensa — id inexistente (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recompensas/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar recompensa (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/recompensas/{{recompensaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Café grátis (médio)",
  "custoPontos": 40
}

### Inativar recompensa (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/recompensas/{{recompensaId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "inativa"
}

### Reativar recompensa — necessário para o teste de resgate (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/recompensas/{{recompensaId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ativa"
}

### Criar recompensa — sem token (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recompensas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Sem token",
  "custoPontos": 10
}
